  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nYou cannot Pendulum Summon, except \"Ryu-Ge\"
    monsters (this effect cannot be negated). You can negate your opponent's card
    or effect activated in response to the activation of your \"Ryu-Ge\" Spell Card
    or effect, then destroy this card. You can only use this effect of \"Tensei Ryu-Ge
    Anva\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nYou can Tribute 1 \"Ryu-Ge\" monster
    from your hand or field, except \"Tensei Ryu-Ge Anva\"; Special Summon this card
    from your hand. If this card is Special Summoned: You can target 1 card on the
    field; destroy it. If this card is destroyed: You can place 1 \"Ryu-Ge\" Continuous
    Spell/Trap from your Deck, GY, or banishment, face-up on your field. You can
    only use each effect of \"Tensei Ryu-Ge Anva\" once per turn."
